{"ID":"20260205093254-3pns50g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3pns50g","title":"11_DenseNet","type":"doc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-zg3sz5o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-zg3sz5o","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DenSeNet"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-9ckqsp9","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9ckqsp9","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-l3va3fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-l3va3fy","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Gao Huang"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人于2018年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Densely Connected Convolutional Network"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出的新架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-cethrx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-cethrx0","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一个非常反常识的事情需要进行阐述，网络结构虽然称作密集连接的卷积神经网络，但他的参数量和计算量并不高，甚至比前一代的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还要低上许多。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3io3r81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3io3r81","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然这个网络架构最主要的启发当然是著作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啦。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3q81g2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3q81g2l","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126091948068"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260127090737441-1446277935.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-i6ewwef","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-i6ewwef","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-tsd7lmp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-tsd7lmp","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型创作背景"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-2d5tskj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-2d5tskj","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2017"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"横空出世，在当时泛起了轩然大波。超级深的卷积神经网络在进行运算过程中产生的梯度爆炸或者是梯度消失等问题几乎得到了完美的解决。不仅仅是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，包括"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"HighwayNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等诸多架构都使用了残差连接这种方式在提高网络深度的同时尽可能的降低模型退化的概率。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-wcd8d08","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-wcd8d08","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-lt6r9nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-lt6r9nj","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里模型的退化，主要就是随着网络深度的增加，模型训练精度不降反升的一种奇怪的现象。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ydbrj7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ydbrj7j","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是本文作者认为，网络一味的提升网络深度是没有多大必要的。原因主要有下面两点："}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-lish63w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-lish63w","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-1zotqis","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-1zotqis","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-93e6zv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-93e6zv7","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络深度增加，哪怕你的模型架构再好，训练过程中的计算量和数据量一定会呈指数级别的上升。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-mkyklgs","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-mkyklgs","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-jyl0pph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-jyl0pph","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络的深度增加，最前面输入的特征早就已经被冲淡了。那网络的增加还有什么意义呢？"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-5x5hn6n","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-5x5hn6n","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-371q4j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-371q4j0","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原文中的表述为：当相关的输入或者是梯度的信息传过了很多中间层的时候，这些信息在网络最后基本上早已被冲淡或者是直接消失。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-c2qtp4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-c2qtp4g","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此在这个背景之下作者主要就是想要解决上面这两个问题，并设计除了一种新的模型架构"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构，这个架构的设计构想主要来源于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-emnpnlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-emnpnlp","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前者主要就是对其短接的残差连接进行思考，后者当然就是块的方式进行类似。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-rlbnlgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-rlbnlgy","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126093641172"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260127090740984-371388090.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-fs546l3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fs546l3","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-lzm2hty","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-lzm2hty","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ll49kuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ll49kuy","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作者提出的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet(密集连接的卷积神经网络)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个网络通过将每一层和其他所有在它之后的层相互连接的方式来消除深度带来的信息消失的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-1xoxa9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-1xoxa9j","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个方法作者认为是特征复用。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-71wnunv","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-71wnunv","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-j33dnhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-j33dnhj","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原本特征就来之不易，直接给人家消去了多不好，因此留几个备份，给后面几个人都看一下，看看我最开始的到底是个什么样子，毕竟一手消息，和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"N"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多手消息是不一样的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-cint50h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-cint50h","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个网络的单个连接层就如下所示。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-7801j4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-7801j4q","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126094306052"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260127090743478-693901607.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-gqm88lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-gqm88lv","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它相较于ResNet主要有下面几个改进："}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-9btiv22","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9btiv22","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-3b9mt0n","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3b9mt0n","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-hs6jj8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-hs6jj8q","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不仅仅只是一次线条进行短接，而是将每个网络的输入于之后所有网络的输入均相互短接在一起，增强特征的重复使用。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-fw5cxih","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fw5cxih","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-v3qef3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-v3qef3j","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的短接是直接将两个网络的特征直接相加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"y = F(x) + x"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，现在做的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Concat"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的操作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"y = torch.cat(F(x) , x)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，将特征图叠在一起。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-v0lns1p","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-v0lns1p","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-ruxweb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ruxweb1","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每一次无论输入的通道数是多少都保证他们有相同的输出通道，同时将这个输出通道定义为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"K"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个的作用是什么呢：对于第一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"H"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而言输入三个通道，输出32个通道；对于第二个H而言输入的就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"32+3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个通道，输出是32个通道；那么以此类推，对于第N个通道，他的输入就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3+32\\times N"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个通道数量。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-obkbjr7","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-obkbjr7","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-e5p3mqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-e5p3mqe","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每一"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Dense"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层的主要结构是一次卷积，一次全局归一化，以及一次非线性激活函数组成的："}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-91o881n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-91o881n","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126095445098"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260127090746207-2036706627.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-n4np8bw","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-n4np8bw","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-slyqbho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-slyqbho","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而每一层的中间过渡层是通过一次卷积，一次全局归一化，以及全局平均池化组成的："}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-kbbwfet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-kbbwfet","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126095610585"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260127090748169-652127506.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3u11c6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3u11c6c","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在将上面的两个模块分别进行命名称作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{layer}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{transition}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，分别对应前者与后者。那么最终的一个Dense块儿就是由这两个相互组成的"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-b6cg8t7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-b6cg8t7","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126095956928"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260127090749931-1278368735.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ntwcojw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ntwcojw","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个模块的组成就对应了中间的函数"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"H"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个用来做标准的稠密连接Dense的主要，另一个就是为了将通道数减半降低运算量。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3nc1hij","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3nc1hij","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-fviv374","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fviv374","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前者解决了深度增加冲淡信息的问题，后者解决了深度增大计算资源过大的问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-fhfjys9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fhfjys9","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-bzyltq9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-bzyltq9","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 模型代码实现"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-saj18bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-saj18bk","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么有了上面的解释就可以对这个进行编写了，主要用的就是基本的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Pytorch"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构来编写"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ufr9bw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ufr9bw3","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先编写一下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{layer}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个层吧。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-8dog67n","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-8dog67n","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"def dense_layer(in_channels , out_channels , bn_size = 4 , drop_rate = 0.5):\n    return (\n        nn.Sequential(\n            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n            nn.Conv2d(\n                in_channels = in_channels , \n                out_channels = bn_size * out_channels, \n                kernel_size = 1 , \n                padding = 0 , \n                stride = 1\n                ),\n            nn.BatchNorm2d(bn_size * out_channels),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n            nn.Conv2d(\n                in_channels = bn_size * out_channels , \n                out_channels = out_channels , \n                kernel_size = 3 , \n                padding = 1 , \n                stride = 1\n                ),\n            nn.Dropout(p = drop_rate) if drop_rate \u003e 0 else nn.Identity()\n        )\n    )\n\n# x = torch.randn(4 , 3 , 32 , 32)\n# layer = dense_layer(3 , 32)\n# print(layer(x).shape)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-djufx84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-djufx84","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次编写一下中间用来过渡的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Dense_{transition}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-a3li3eg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-a3li3eg","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"def dense_transition(in_channels , out_channels):\n    return (\n        nn.Sequential(\n            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n            nn.Conv2d(\n                in_channels=in_channels , \n                out_channels=out_channels,\n                kernel_size=1,\n                padding = 0 ,\n                stride=1\n            ),\n            nn.AvgPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n        )\n    )\n\n# x = torch.randn(4 , 64 , 32 , 32)\n# layer = dense_transition(64 , 32)\n# print(layer(x).shape)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-jo1fzcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-jo1fzcy","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后将整一个Dense块儿给他搞一下"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-w32590c","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-w32590c","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"class DenseBlock(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self , num_layers , in_channels ,  growth_rate = 32):\n        super(DenseBlock , self).__init__()\n        self.num_layers = num_layers\n        layers = []\n        for i in range (self.num_layers):\n            layer = dense_layer(\n                in_channels= in_channels +i * growth_rate,\n                out_channels= growth_rate\n            )\n            layers.append(layer)\n        self.layers = nn.Sequential(*layers)\n\n    def forward(self , x):\n        for layer in self.layers:\n            y = layer(x)\n            x = torch.cat([x , y] , dim =1)\n        return x\n\n# x = torch.randn(4 , 2 , 32 , 32)\n# layer = DenseBlock(num_layers=1 , in_channels=2 , growth_rate=32)\n# layer(x).size()\n        \n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-f4zgktt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-f4zgktt","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的结构就出来了"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-6mtebgp","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-6mtebgp","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"class DenseNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self , growth_rate = 32 , num_classes = 10 , in_channels = 3 , init_features = 64):\n        super(DenseNet , self).__init__()\n\n        # 初始卷积层\n        self.init_conv = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Conv2d(\n                in_channels= in_channels ,\n                out_channels = init_features ,\n                kernel_size = 7 ,\n                stride = 2 ,\n                padding = 3\n                ),\n            nn.BatchNorm2d(init_features),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace = True),\n            nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=2 , padding=1),\n            )\n        \n        # 密集块和过度层\n        num_channels = init_features\n        self.block1 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 6 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n        num_channels = num_channels + 6 * growth_rate\n        self.trans1 = dense_transition(in_channels = num_channels , out_channels = num_channels // 2)\n        num_channels = num_channels // 2\n\n        self.block2 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 12 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n        num_channels = num_channels + 12 * growth_rate\n        self.trans2 = dense_transition(in_channels = num_channels , out_channels = num_channels // 2)\n        num_channels = num_channels // 2\n\n        self.block3 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 24 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n        num_channels = num_channels + 24 * growth_rate\n        self.trans3 = dense_transition(in_channels = num_channels , out_channels = num_channels // 2)\n        num_channels = num_channels // 2\n\n        self.block4 = DenseBlock(num_layers = 16 , in_channels = num_channels , growth_rate = growth_rate)\n        num_channels = num_channels + 16 * growth_rate\n\n        # 全局平均池化和分类层\n        self.global_avg_pool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d((1 , 1))\n        self.classifier = nn.Linear(num_channels , num_classes)\n\n    def forward(self , x):\n        x = self.init_conv(x)\n        x = self.block1(x)\n        x = self.trans1(x)\n        x = self.block2(x)\n        x = self.trans2(x)\n        x = self.block3(x)\n        x = self.trans3(x)\n        x = self.block4(x)\n        x = self.global_avg_pool(x)\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = self.classifier(x)\n        return x\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-q5oi306","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-q5oi306","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-uujzofd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-uujzofd","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该说是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的一种变体，它虽然是在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的基础上进行改进的但是仍然具有很大的数据量，今后的使用较少。"}]}]}]}